// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig.
//
// HeartChart currently needs NO API keys — Bluetooth LE is the only data
// source, and it must stay that way unless a feature genuinely requires
// one (see CLAUDE.md: no publicly available API keys, ever).
//
// If a key ever becomes necessary, it enters here as an environment
// variable, following the TheMovieDBSwift pattern. The $(NAME) form
// resolves from the environment when building via xcodebuild or Xcode
// launched from that shell; paste a literal value instead for
// Dock-launched Xcode:
//   SomeServiceKey = $(SOME_SERVICE_KEY)
// Then set the xcconfig as the target's base configuration, reference the
// setting from Info.plist, and fail fast at launch when it's empty.
// Secrets.xcconfig is git-ignored; never commit real credentials.
